* {{a|southern Germany|Austria|Switzerland}} {{IPA|de|/ˈʁɪçtɪk/}}
* {{audio|de|De-richtig.ogg|audio (Germany)}}
* {{audio|de|De-at-richtig.ogg|audio (Austria)}}
